From 92dd39b8190f3dfd35e87e39eee4a4314b8f895f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:34:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Remove unused CMake files

Only cmake/modules/tfel.cmake, included by CMakeLists.txt, and
cmake/modules/mfront-behaviours.cmake, included by tfel.cmake, are used.
The other files were copied from mfem-mgis when the repository was
created and are referenced nowhere. The output of the configuration is
unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
